<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/f2df56db-c064-49fa-bb08-700336cf6a24> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Rationale: slop-rdf v0.3.0 tag does not build under SLOP 0.3.0" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
